  "manifest_format_note": "Tier-2 manifest uses the same files.global / from-to / smoke_tests format as tier 0, 1, 3, 4, 5 and the install.sh / verify.sh scripts. Artifact 3's draft used a divergent installs.* / src-dest / verify structure that the installer does not read — corrected here for consistency. See Tier 2 install log.",
  "codex_note": "ADR-030: the OpenAI/GPT-5.5 family reaches review via the OpenAI API by DEFAULT (scripts/lib/openai-review.sh, oair_call); the codex CLI is an opt-in transport (codex_transport=cli). So `command: codex` is now ADVISORY (requirements[].advisory + advisory_smoke_tests) — a missing codex CLI warns, never fails the install. Earlier: ADR-011 routed OpenAI-family work through the local Codex CLI (hard requirement `command: codex`)."
